{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qedg9l","slideIndex":2,"text":"[0:45–1:15] HeartV0 has two learning paths. Guided Learning explains the sequence in short steps while keeping the model interactive. Free Exploration lets the learner follow development, investigate structures and branch into congenital differences. Vision Pro supports the learning goal because the student can physically inspect depth and layers instead of reconstructing them from a flat page."}
